-page_title "Free API Key"
-breadcrumb :api_key

%p Press the button to see your API key. It is shown only once, so please copy it and keep it somewhere safe.

=form_with url: issue_api_key_path, method: :post, data: { turbo: false } do |f|
  =hidden_field_tag :token, @token
  =f.button "Show my API key", class: "btn-saves btn-md"
